<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">To the distant light above,</font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:14,150 --> 00:01:17,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">ON THE WAY</font></b></font></font>

26
00:01:14,150 --> 00:01:17,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">yes, we are on the way!</font></b></font></font>

27
00:01:22,070 --> 00:01:28,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I WANNA ROCKS mune ni ROCKS</font></b></font></font>

28
00:01:22,070 --> 00:01:28,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

29
00:01:32,030 --> 00:01:33,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's late.</font>

30
00:01:42,910 --> 00:01:43,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

31
00:01:43,830 --> 00:01:45,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stay still.</font>

32
00:01:45,250 --> 00:01:50,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why's it that only
our team's teacher is late?</font>

33
00:01:50,750 --> 00:01:54,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The other teams have gone off
somewhere with their new teachers,</font>

34
00:01:54,550 --> 00:01:56,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and Iruka-sensei's also left.</font>

35
00:01:56,970 --> 00:01:58,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't look at me.</font>

36
00:01:59,930 --> 00:02:02,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, what're you doing, Naruto?!</font>

37
00:02:06,390 --> 00:02:07,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

38
00:02:08,190 --> 00:02:11,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll be his fault because he's late.</font>

39
00:02:15,740 --> 00:02:18,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man! You're asking for it!</font>

40
00:02:18,950 --> 00:02:21,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I like stuff like this!</font>

41
00:02:22,660 --> 00:02:26,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Jonin wouldn't get caught
in such a weak booby trap.</font>

42
00:02:26,660 --> 00:02:30,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right. You're such an idiot...!</font>

43
00:02:38,050 --> 00:02:39,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got him, I got him...</font>

44
00:02:41,470 --> 00:02:43,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I'm sorry, sir.</font>

45
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:46,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I tried to stop him,
but Naruto-kun did it on his own...</font>

46
00:02:47,350 --> 00:02:48,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all good.</font>

47
00:02:49,940 --> 00:02:52,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get real.
Is he really a Jonin?</font>

48
00:02:59,030 --> 00:03:00,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How can I put this?</font>

49
00:03:00,740 --> 00:03:02,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for my first impression
of you guys...?</font>

50
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:04,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I hate you.</font>

51
00:03:08,540 --> 00:03:14,540
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The</font>

52
00:03:08,540 --> 00:03:14,540
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Trial!</font>

53
00:03:08,540 --> 00:03:14,540
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Survival Training</font>

54
00:03:16,250 --> 00:03:17,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's see.</font>

55
00:03:17,510 --> 00:03:19,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First off, let me have
you guys introduce yourselves.</font>

56
00:03:20,380 --> 00:03:21,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Introduce ourselves...</font>

57
00:03:23,140 --> 00:03:24,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should we say?</font>

58
00:03:25,050 --> 00:03:31,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your likes, dislikes, your future
dream, hobbies,</font>

59
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:33,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">things like that!</font>

60
00:03:33,060 --> 00:03:38,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Before that, please tell us
about yourself.</font>

61
00:03:39,320 --> 00:03:43,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me? My name's Hatake Kakashi.</font>

62
00:03:45,660 --> 00:03:48,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't feel like telling you
guys about my likes and dislikes.</font>

63
00:03:50,580 --> 00:03:53,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never really thought
about my future dream...</font>

64
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:57,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for my hobbies, I have many.</font>

65
00:03:58,500 --> 00:04:01,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the end,
isn't all we know his name?</font>

66
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

67
00:04:03,130 --> 00:04:04,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next is you guys.</font>

68
00:04:05,850 --> 00:04:07,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's start with you.</font>

69
00:04:07,510 --> 00:04:10,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My name's Uzumaki Naruto!</font>

70
00:04:10,430 --> 00:04:11,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I like instant ramen,</font>

71
00:04:12,060 --> 00:04:15,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but what I like even more
is the ramen from Ichiraku</font>

72
00:04:15,230 --> 00:04:16,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that Iruka-sensei treats me to.</font>

73
00:04:17,190 --> 00:04:18,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What I dislike is the three minutes</font>

74
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:20,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">after pouring hot water
in the instant ramen.</font>

75
00:04:20,860 --> 00:04:22,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My hobby is eating and
comparing ramen!</font>

76
00:04:23,610 --> 00:04:25,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And my future dream...</font>

77
00:04:25,820 --> 00:04:27,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is to surpass the Hokage!</font>

78
00:04:28,030 --> 00:04:29,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And so I'm going to get
the entire village</font>

79
00:04:29,830 --> 00:04:33,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to acknowledge my existence!</font>

80
00:04:34,710 --> 00:04:35,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

81
00:04:36,170 --> 00:04:38,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this kid's grown up in
an interesting way.</font>

82
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:41,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, next.</font>

83
00:04:42,260 --> 00:04:43,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Haruno Sakura.</font>

84
00:04:44,180 --> 00:04:48,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What I like... I mean, who I like is...</font>

85
00:04:50,810 --> 00:04:53,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, my hobby is,
I mean...</font>

86
00:04:54,730 --> 00:04:56,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My future dream is...</font>

87
00:04:58,730 --> 00:05:01,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And?
What about your dislikes?</font>

88
00:05:02,490 --> 00:05:03,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

89
00:05:06,450 --> 00:05:08,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Girls at her age are probably
more interested in love</font>

90
00:05:08,490 --> 00:05:09,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">than the Ninja Arts.</font>

91
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:11,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And lastly.</font>

92
00:05:12,410 --> 00:05:14,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My name's... Uchiha Sasuke.</font>

93
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:19,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have lots of dislikes,
but no likes in particular.</font>

94
00:05:20,670 --> 00:05:21,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

95
00:05:22,340 --> 00:05:23,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And...</font>

96
00:05:23,550 --> 00:05:25,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't feel like summing up
my ambition as just a dream</font>

97
00:05:25,970 --> 00:05:27,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I do have an ambition!</font>

98
00:05:27,970 --> 00:05:31,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The ambition to restore my clan
and without fail...</font>

99
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:34,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to kill a certain man!</font>

100
00:05:42,730 --> 00:05:43,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He doesn't...</font>

101
00:05:43,730 --> 00:05:45,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">mean me, does he?</font>

102
00:05:45,860 --> 00:05:48,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure enough, Sasuke-kun's cool.</font>

103
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:50,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew it...</font>

104
00:05:51,660 --> 00:05:52,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good!</font>

105
00:05:52,700 --> 00:05:54,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The three of you are very distinctive
and interesting!</font>

106
00:05:56,540 --> 00:05:58,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll have a mission tomorrow!</font>

107
00:05:58,540 --> 00:06:01,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir! What kind of mission?</font>

108
00:06:01,670 --> 00:06:04,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, we'll do what we can do
with just four people.</font>

109
00:06:05,510 --> 00:06:07,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What what what?!</font>

110
00:06:09,180 --> 00:06:10,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A survival exercise.</font>

111
00:06:11,510 --> 00:06:13,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Survival exercise?</font>

112
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:14,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are we doing an exercise</font>

113
00:06:14,930 --> 00:06:16,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even though this is supposed
to be a mission?</font>

114
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:20,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've had more than our share
of exercises in the Academy!</font>

115
00:06:20,860 --> 00:06:22,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is no simple exercise.</font>

116
00:06:23,070 --> 00:06:26,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then... then what kind of exercise is it?</font>

117
00:06:34,740 --> 00:06:37,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! What's so funny, Sensei?</font>

118
00:06:38,830 --> 00:06:43,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh, well, if I tell you,
I know you'll grow disenchanted.</font>

119
00:06:43,630 --> 00:06:44,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

120
00:06:45,460 --> 00:06:47,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of the twenty-seven graduates,</font>

121
00:06:48,130 --> 00:06:51,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">only nine will be recognized
as Genin.</font>

122
00:06:52,140 --> 00:06:55,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The remaining eighteen will
be sent back to the Academy.</font>

123
00:06:56,220 --> 00:06:59,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, this exercise
is an extremely difficult test</font>

124
00:06:59,890 --> 00:07:02,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with a failure rate of 66% or higher!</font>

125
00:07:05,070 --> 00:07:05,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See, see?</font>

126
00:07:05,980 --> 00:07:07,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You got disenchanted!</font>

127
00:07:07,990 --> 00:07:09,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's crazy!</font>

128
00:07:09,570 --> 00:07:10,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To have suffered that much!</font>

129
00:07:10,990 --> 00:07:14,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-Then, what was
the graduation test for?</font>

130
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:15,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, that.</font>

131
00:07:16,370 --> 00:07:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was just to select those who have
the potential of becoming Genin.</font>

132
00:07:19,660 --> 00:07:21,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

133
00:07:22,210 --> 00:07:23,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, that's the way it is.</font>

134
00:07:23,960 --> 00:07:27,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be determining whether
you pass or fail.</font>

135
00:07:28,090 --> 00:07:29,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bring your complete set
of Shinobi tools!</font>

136
00:07:29,970 --> 00:07:31,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We meet at five in the morning.</font>

137
00:07:34,930 --> 00:07:38,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No way am I going to be
dropped now!</font>

138
00:07:38,350 --> 00:07:42,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got to have my strength
recognized for real.</font>

139
00:07:42,810 --> 00:07:46,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be separated from Sasuke-kun
if I fail this test.</font>

140
00:07:47,070 --> 00:07:48,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is an exercise of love!</font>

141
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:55,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! You're dismissed.</font>

142
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:58,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... And you'd best skip breakfast.</font>

143
00:07:59,410 --> 00:08:00,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll throw up.</font>

144
00:08:12,380 --> 00:08:13,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Morning.</font>

145
00:08:42,540 --> 00:08:44,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hi, folks. Good morning!</font>

146
00:08:45,210 --> 00:08:47,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're late!</font>

147
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:51,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, a black cat crossed
my path, you see.</font>

148
00:08:54,590 --> 00:08:56,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ahem! Oh well...</font>

149
00:08:59,180 --> 00:09:01,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, it's set for 12:00!</font>

150
00:09:05,350 --> 00:09:09,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today's assignment is to take
these bells away from me by noon.</font>

151
00:09:13,400 --> 00:09:15,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who can't do it won't get lunch.</font>

152
00:09:16,530 --> 00:09:18,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They'll be tied to that...</font>

153
00:09:18,530 --> 00:09:20,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I'll eat my lunch
before your very eyes.</font>

154
00:09:22,450 --> 00:09:23,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that was the point...</font>

155
00:09:24,660 --> 00:09:26,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for us not to eat breakfast...</font>

156
00:09:26,580 --> 00:09:27,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, hold on.</font>

157
00:09:28,330 --> 00:09:29,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are there only two bells?</font>

158
00:09:31,590 --> 00:09:33,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are only two,
so at the very least,</font>

159
00:09:33,170 --> 00:09:34,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one will have to
go to the logs.</font>

160
00:09:34,970 --> 00:09:37,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That person will be disqualified
for failing the mission...</font>

161
00:09:38,220 --> 00:09:39,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and will return to the Academy.</font>

162
00:09:40,680 --> 00:09:42,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It might be one person
at the very least,</font>

163
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:44,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">or it could be all three of you.</font>

164
00:09:45,060 --> 00:09:46,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can use your Shuriken.</font>

165
00:09:47,350 --> 00:09:50,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't be able to take the bells
unless you come with the intent to kill me.</font>

166
00:09:52,070 --> 00:09:54,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, that's dangerous, sir!</font>

167
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:55,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yeah, that's right!</font>

168
00:09:55,820 --> 00:09:57,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You couldn't even evade
a chalkboard eraser!</font>

169
00:09:57,860 --> 00:09:59,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In this world,</font>

170
00:09:59,450 --> 00:10:01,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">those who aren't skilled enough
tend to complain more.</font>

171
00:10:02,330 --> 00:10:04,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, just ignore the loser...</font>

172
00:10:06,160 --> 00:10:07,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Begin when I give
the "ready-go" signal.</font>

173
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Loser, loser, loser.</font>

174
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:29,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be so hasty.
I didn't say start, yet.</font>

175
00:10:37,490 --> 00:10:38,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...!</font>

176
00:10:38,650 --> 00:10:39,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't see him at all.</font>

177
00:10:40,910 --> 00:10:42,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this is a Jonin.</font>

178
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:43,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, that's fine.</font>

179
00:10:44,030 --> 00:10:47,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At least you came with
the intent to kill me.</font>

180
00:10:49,500 --> 00:10:50,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How can I put this...?</font>

181
00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:52,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I feel like I'm finally starting...</font>

182
00:10:52,130 --> 00:10:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to like you guys.</font>

183
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:55,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're going to start.</font>

184
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:59,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ready... start!</font>

185
00:11:03,350 --> 00:11:04,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you want to know?</font>

186
00:11:06,770 --> 00:11:10,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't think you just
came here to drink tea.</font>

187
00:11:11,060 --> 00:11:13,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Jonin in Naruto and company's
Team 7...</font>

188
00:11:14,190 --> 00:11:17,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What kind of teacher is he?
Is he strict?</font>

189
00:11:19,030 --> 00:11:22,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You mean Kakashi?
Does he concern you?</font>

190
00:11:23,570 --> 00:11:26,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard a rumor that concerns me.</font>

191
00:11:34,210 --> 00:11:34,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?</font>

192
00:11:36,210 --> 00:11:38,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a pass-fail list of
the Genin</font>

193
00:11:38,630 --> 00:11:40,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi has been
in charge of up until now.</font>

194
00:11:43,180 --> 00:11:44,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me have a look.</font>

195
00:11:50,520 --> 00:11:52,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This is...!</font>

196
00:11:55,860 --> 00:11:59,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fundamentally, Shinobi must mask
their presence and hide.</font>

197
00:12:08,160 --> 00:12:10,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, everyone is hidden pretty well...</font>

198
00:12:13,870 --> 00:12:17,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Alright! Let's face off
fair and square!</font>

199
00:12:17,540 --> 00:12:18,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh?</font>

200
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:20,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That goof.</font>

201
00:12:21,470 --> 00:12:24,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say, aren't you a bit
off-kilter?</font>

202
00:12:24,390 --> 00:12:27,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's off-kilter
is your hairstyle!</font>

203
00:12:39,730 --> 00:12:42,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll teach you the first
Shinobi Battle Jutsu...</font>

204
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Taijutsu.</font>

205
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:49,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Taijutsu...?</font>

206
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:51,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's ninja hand-to-hand combat...</font>

207
00:12:51,330 --> 00:12:53,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That being said...
he's going to use weapons?</font>

208
00:12:54,920 --> 00:13:00,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"Make-Out Paradise"</b></font>

209
00:13:03,220 --> 00:13:04,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?</font>

210
00:13:04,340 --> 00:13:05,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you come at me?</font>

211
00:13:05,880 --> 00:13:09,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But hey... what's with the book?</font>

212
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:10,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you ask...?</font>

213
00:13:11,430 --> 00:13:14,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because I was curious
about what happens next.</font>

214
00:13:14,890 --> 00:13:15,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry.</font>

215
00:13:16,310 --> 00:13:17,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With you guys as opponents,</font>

216
00:13:17,860 --> 00:13:19,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it makes no difference
if I'm reading or not.</font>

217
00:13:21,860 --> 00:13:23,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to rip you apart!</font>

218
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:29,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! This time a spin kick!</font>

219
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:31,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man!</font>

220
00:13:34,830 --> 00:13:35,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!</font>

221
00:13:36,420 --> 00:13:39,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja shouldn't let the enemy take them
from behind multiple times, fool.</font>

222
00:13:40,630 --> 00:13:42,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The way his hands are positioned...</font>

223
00:13:42,880 --> 00:13:44,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that the Sign of the Tiger?!</font>

224
00:13:44,470 --> 00:13:45,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

225
00:13:45,170 --> 00:13:46,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With Naruto as his opponent,</font>

226
00:13:46,510 --> 00:13:48,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that's too strong a Ninjutsu
no matter how you look at it.</font>

227
00:13:49,090 --> 00:13:51,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Sign...
It's a fire-style skill.</font>

228
00:13:52,560 --> 00:13:55,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That idiot teacher's doing more
than just running around?</font>

229
00:13:55,680 --> 00:13:57,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, get out of there quick!</font>

230
00:13:57,850 --> 00:13:59,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll die!</font>

231
00:14:00,230 --> 00:14:01,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too late.</font>

232
00:14:02,230 --> 00:14:04,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Village Secret!
Ultimate Taijutsu!</font>

233
00:14:09,070 --> 00:14:10,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One Thousand Years of Death!</font>

234
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:15,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's not a Ninjutsu.</font>

235
00:14:16,210 --> 00:14:18,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those two are idiots.</font>

236
00:14:24,130 --> 00:14:25,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Alright...</font>

237
00:14:32,890 --> 00:14:35,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even so, isn't that against the rules?</font>

238
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:38,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're we supposed to do
about his strength?</font>

239
00:14:43,520 --> 00:14:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

240
00:14:44,820 --> 00:14:46,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It wasn't supposed to be
like this.</font>

241
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:00,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It... can't be!</font>

242
00:15:00,330 --> 00:15:02,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is more than just a rumor.</font>

243
00:15:03,250 --> 00:15:06,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi's test might
be a bit difficult...</font>

244
00:15:08,130 --> 00:15:12,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even so, this means absolutely
no one has passed...!</font>

245
00:15:12,640 --> 00:15:13,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

246
00:15:13,510 --> 00:15:17,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi has never had someone pass.</font>

247
00:15:17,390 --> 00:15:18,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They have all...</font>

248
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:20,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">been annihilated...</font>

249
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:27,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?</font>

250
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:30,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't get lunch if you can't
take the bell by noon.</font>

251
00:15:31,530 --> 00:15:33,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that.</font>

252
00:15:34,030 --> 00:15:36,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not very energetic,</font>

253
00:15:36,160 --> 00:15:38,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">considering you said that
you'd surpass the Hokage.</font>

254
00:15:39,500 --> 00:15:43,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! Damn it!
I can fight even if I'm hungry.</font>

255
00:15:46,380 --> 00:15:49,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't even have dinner last night.</font>

256
00:15:50,920 --> 00:15:53,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I shouldn't have gone on a diet.</font>

257
00:15:54,260 --> 00:15:57,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just got a bit careless earlier!</font>

258
00:15:57,970 --> 00:16:00,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! I'm hungry, so my strength...</font>

259
00:16:01,230 --> 00:16:04,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... I've got to take the bell,
no matter what.</font>

260
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:06,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter what...</font>

261
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:09,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm... not...</font>

262
00:16:10,400 --> 00:16:12,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">turning back now!</font>

263
00:16:16,530 --> 00:16:17,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to become a Ninja!</font>

264
00:16:28,340 --> 00:16:29,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Security is your greatest enemy!</font>

265
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:33,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now for my favorite
Multi-Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

266
00:16:34,430 --> 00:16:36,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seven... Narutos?</font>

267
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:42,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? They're not just images?</font>

268
00:16:43,560 --> 00:16:45,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are they all real?
The real thing?</font>

269
00:16:52,740 --> 00:16:55,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not the clone,
but the shadow clone, eh.</font>

270
00:16:57,320 --> 00:17:01,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you ever lay a hand on Iruka-sensei,
I'll kill you!</font>

271
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:04,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Show me what you can do, Demon Fox!</font>

272
00:17:11,380 --> 00:17:15,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those aren't just images
but actual clones!</font>

273
00:17:15,760 --> 00:17:16,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's an advanced Ninjutsu!</font>

274
00:17:18,600 --> 00:17:22,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the forbidden Jutsu
that did in Mizuki.</font>

275
00:17:24,390 --> 00:17:26,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Judging from your ability,</font>

276
00:17:26,350 --> 00:17:28,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that Jutsu should have
a one-minute limit.</font>

277
00:17:29,690 --> 00:17:31,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you talk trash,</font>

278
00:17:31,820 --> 00:17:33,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto is Naruto
after all is said and done...</font>

279
00:17:34,530 --> 00:17:37,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You still can't beat me with that skill.</font>

280
00:17:40,370 --> 00:17:41,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What?! Behind me?!</font>

281
00:17:48,170 --> 00:17:51,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja shouldn't let
the enemy take them from behind.</font>

282
00:17:51,630 --> 00:17:53,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, Kakashi-sensei?</font>

283
00:17:54,090 --> 00:17:55,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Using the Shadow Clone,</font>

284
00:17:55,470 --> 00:17:56,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had one of them come up</font>

285
00:17:56,970 --> 00:18:00,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from the bottom of the river
and sneak behind you!</font>

286
00:18:00,760 --> 00:18:03,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here's one for that attack
on my butt earlier!</font>

287
00:18:03,810 --> 00:18:05,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, not bad!</font>

288
00:18:06,100 --> 00:18:07,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... a diversionary tactic, eh?</font>

289
00:18:10,230 --> 00:18:11,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now... allow me to punch you!</font>

290
00:18:21,490 --> 00:18:22,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

291
00:18:29,250 --> 00:18:30,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The one who got punched was...</font>

292
00:18:33,300 --> 00:18:34,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto?</font>

293
00:18:35,630 --> 00:18:37,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch!</font>

294
00:18:37,300 --> 00:18:38,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...!</font>

295
00:18:38,760 --> 00:18:41,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're Kakashi-sensei, right?!</font>

296
00:18:41,220 --> 00:18:43,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You used the Transformation Jutsu
to change yourself, didn't you?!</font>

297
00:18:43,600 --> 00:18:44,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's you!</font>

298
00:18:44,430 --> 00:18:45,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're Kakashi-sensei.</font>

299
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:48,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You smell like Kakashi-sensei!</font>

300
00:18:48,560 --> 00:18:49,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The smell of an old guy!</font>

301
00:18:51,270 --> 00:18:52,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why you...!</font>

302
00:18:52,520 --> 00:18:56,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! For the time being,
let's try undoing the Jutsu.</font>

303
00:18:56,530 --> 00:18:59,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we do that,
only the two will remain... so...</font>

304
00:18:59,320 --> 00:19:00,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should've realized that sooner,
you idiot!</font>

305
00:19:01,240 --> 00:19:04,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're me, you idiot!
Just undo the Jutsu!</font>

306
00:19:12,960 --> 00:19:13,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

307
00:19:14,500 --> 00:19:15,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're embarrassing to watch...</font>

308
00:19:16,170 --> 00:19:18,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was the Substitution Jutsu,
you fool.</font>

309
00:19:19,470 --> 00:19:22,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Essentially, it's a skill used
to quickly switch one's own body</font>

310
00:19:22,510 --> 00:19:24,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with an object or animal.</font>

311
00:19:24,930 --> 00:19:28,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This makes your enemy think
you're being attacked,</font>

312
00:19:28,560 --> 00:19:30,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but then you strike during
their unguarded moment.</font>

313
00:19:31,060 --> 00:19:35,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After letting himself get caught
by the real Naruto,</font>

314
00:19:35,360 --> 00:19:39,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Jonin fool switched bodies
with one of the clone Narutos.</font>

315
00:19:39,740 --> 00:19:41,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not only did he make Naruto
think he'd been nailed...</font>

316
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:44,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he used Naruto's own attack on him.</font>

317
00:19:51,540 --> 00:19:52,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A bell?!</font>

318
00:19:53,830 --> 00:19:55,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You really must have been in a hurry.</font>

319
00:19:56,000 --> 00:19:57,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've dropped a bell!</font>

320
00:20:02,300 --> 00:20:04,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the heck is this?!</font>

321
00:20:06,810 --> 00:20:08,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course it's a trap...</font>

322
00:20:09,310 --> 00:20:12,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-H-Hey!</font>

323
00:20:12,600 --> 00:20:18,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Jonin doesn't lower his guard
even when he's fighting Naruto.</font>

324
00:20:18,480 --> 00:20:20,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The bell!</font>

325
00:20:24,870 --> 00:20:26,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have to think when using Jutsu.</font>

326
00:20:27,830 --> 00:20:30,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They can be used against you.</font>

327
00:20:31,870 --> 00:20:32,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also...</font>

328
00:20:34,120 --> 00:20:37,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...don't get caught in
an obvious trap, you fool.</font>

329
00:20:39,880 --> 00:20:42,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Ninja must see
through deception!</font>

330
00:20:42,380 --> 00:20:45,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that!</font>

331
00:20:45,640 --> 00:20:48,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know, I'm telling you
because you don't get it.</font>

332
00:20:48,260 --> 00:20:49,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen up!</font>

333
00:20:50,850 --> 00:20:53,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your movements are wasteful.</font>

334
00:20:54,270 --> 00:20:55,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now!</font>

335
00:20:59,070 --> 00:21:00,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He finally dropped his guard!</font>

